#. type: Title #
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sleep Mechanism"
msgstr "睡眠机制"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Light Sleep is the incremental extraction channel (semantic + limbic + autobiographical); Deep Sleep optimizes semantic memory inventory.\n"
msgstr "> 浅睡是增量提取通道（语义 + 感性 + 自传体）；深睡优化语义记忆库存。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:12
msgid ""
"Sleep is the digital life's memory consolidation mechanism—analogous to "
"human sleep where the brain replays daytime experiences, converts short-term "
"memory to long-term storage; the consolidation process itself dissipates, "
"leaving no trace."
msgstr ""
"睡眠是数字生命的记忆整理机制，类比人类的睡眠——大脑在夜间回放白天的经历，将临"
"时记忆转化为长期存储，整理过程本身消散，不留痕迹。"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:19
msgid ""
"**Internal mechanism, no trace** — Sleep runs in background, does not write "
"to conversations, does not affect conversation flow"
msgstr "**内部机制，不留痕迹** — 睡眠在后台运行，不写入 session，不影响对话流"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:19
msgid ""
"**Do not copy human rhythm literally** — Triggered by system need (cron), "
"not real-time"
msgstr "**不照搬人类的节奏** — 触发基于系统需求（cron），非实时"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:19
msgid ""
"**Two-tier layering** — Light sleep (incremental writes), deep sleep "
"(semantic inventory optimization)"
msgstr "**两级分层** — 浅睡（增量写入）、深睡（语义库存优化）"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:19
msgid ""
"**Identity context** — All memory processing must carry **self layer six "
"blocks** + resident memory (see [`self-layer.md`](self-layer.md))"
msgstr ""
"**身份上下文** — 所有记忆处理必须携带**自我层六块** + 常驻记忆（见 [`self-"
"layer.md`](self-layer.md)）"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Current State"
msgstr "当前状态"

