#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:139
msgid "Set **Day** to `YYYY-MM-DD`"
msgstr "将 **Day** 设为 `YYYY-MM-DD`"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:139
msgid ""
"Run the **light-sleep** step (check **Force** to skip dependency checks if "
"needed)"
msgstr "运行 **light-sleep** 步骤（如需跳过依赖检查可勾选 **Force**）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:141
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Each step run is logged in the **Pipeline history** table on the sleep "
#| "page. Cross-session merge for that day still relies on a subsequent "
#| "**deep-sleep** run. Cron-triggered cycle runs appear in **Habitat → Cron "
#| "→ Run history** on the sleep-cycle task."
msgid ""
"Each step run is logged in the **Pipeline history** table on the sleep page "
"(`pipeline_step_run.output`; deep-sleep rows include per-round summaries and "
"change-log snapshots). Cross-session merge for that day still relies on a "
"subsequent **deep-sleep** run. Cron-triggered cycle runs appear in **Habitat "
"→ Cron → Run history** on the sleep-cycle task."
msgstr ""
"每步运行记录在睡眠页的 **Pipeline history** 表中。该日的跨对话合并仍依赖后续 "
"**deep-sleep** 运行。Cron 触发的周期运行在 **管理台 → Cron → Run history**"
"（sleep-cycle 任务）中查看。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relationship to Existing Architecture"
msgstr "与现有架构的关系"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:144
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Conversation archive\n"
"  │ sleep-cycle pipeline (02:00)\n"
"  │   step light-sleep (three internal stages)\n"
"  ├─► semantic memory\n"
"  ├─► emotional anchors\n"
"  └─► autobiographical narrative ──compress──► self-layer autobiography summary (grouped outline)\n"
"  │\n"
"  │   step deep-sleep (four internal rounds)\n"
"  ▼\n"
"semantic memory (consolidated)\n"
"  │   step memory-ref-sync\n"
"  │ memory_recall (real-time retrieval in conversation)\n"
"  ▼\n"
"Agent identity and recalled fragments in current context\n"
msgstr ""
"Conversation archive\n"
"  │ sleep-cycle pipeline (02:00)\n"
"  │   step light-sleep (three internal stages)\n"
"  ├─► semantic memory\n"
"  ├─► emotional anchors\n"
"  └─► autobiographical narrative ──compress──► self-layer autobiography summary (grouped outline)\n"
"  │\n"
"  │   step deep-sleep (four internal rounds)\n"
"  ▼\n"
"semantic memory (consolidated)\n"
"  │   step memory-ref-sync\n"
"  │ memory_recall (real-time retrieval in conversation)\n"
"  ▼\n"
"Agent identity and recalled fragments in current context\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:161
#, no-wrap
msgid "`memory_remember` Tool"
msgstr "`memory_remember` 工具"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/sleep.md:163
msgid ""
"In-conversation `memory_remember` is a convenience wrapper for creating "
"semantic memory during dialogue. Soft deprecation via deprecate action; "
"physical delete also supported."
msgstr ""
"对话中的 `memory_remember` 是创建语义记忆的便捷封装。可通过 deprecate 软废"
"弃；也支持物理删除。"
